  "dialogue": [
    {
      "turn_id": 0,
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "您好，这里是陈慧敏。请问有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 1,
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "慧敏，您好，我是林志安。I've got my investment notes here and would like to talk them through. My identification number is F zero five two nine eight two three J. 我的出生日期是一九九三年七月二十二日。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 2,
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "谢谢您。您现在方便谈吗？如果手边有笔记，可以慢慢查看，不用着急。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 3,
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "方便，我在办公室，门已经关好了。我看着手边的笔记，我选的是海港新元债券基金。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 4,
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "在继续之前，关于日常的投资组合更新，您比较喜欢简短摘要，还是把详细资料放在正文里？"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 5,
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "A short summary would be much easier to read between meetings. 详细资料放附件就好，我有空再打开，不用把正文写得太长。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 6,
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "我会记下这个沟通偏好。摘要和附件可以分开整理，方便您查阅。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 7,
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "Sorry, I was looking at an old note. I withdraw that earlier fund selection; the fund I actually want is Nova Technology Equity Fund. 我的笔记夹里混了以前的资料，刚才翻页才发现。"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 8,
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "Thank you for checking your notes. So your objective is long-term capital growth through technology companies, using money you do not need for near-term business or personal expenses. I recommend Nova Technology Equity Fund because its technology shareholdings match your sector interest and long-term growth objective. Not needing this money for near-term expenses also gives you more time to ride out market fluctuations."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 9,
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "I'll keep that in mind. Let me put these loose pages aside so they don't get mixed up again."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 10,
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "For the proposed transaction, we could use Singapore dollars as the transaction currency."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": 11,
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
